WEBVTT

00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:09,360
It's more common than breast cancer.

00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:14,040
It has over 150 different symptoms associated with it.

00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:15,080
What is it?

00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:16,560
Lyme disease.

00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:20,840
My wife nearly lost her life to chronic Lyme disease.

00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:22,680
That changed everything.

00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:25,360
That's why I'm so passionate about this subject.

00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:27,200
I'm Dr. J. Davidson.

00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:31,960
After doing three consecutive chronic Lyme disease summits

00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,760
with over 100 different interviews,

00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:37,560
I get asked all the time, Dr. J,

00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:40,200
what do I need to know about Lyme disease?

00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:43,000
Well, I've put it all together in one event,

00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,520
the best of the best out there,

00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:50,160
including Dr. Mercola, Dr. Klinghark, Dr. Todd Watts,

00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:54,120
Dr. Jill Carnahan, Dr. Horowitz, Dr. Cowden,

00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:59,120
Dr. Christine Schaffner, even my wife, Dr. Heather Davidson.

00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:03,480
To bring you the solutions that you have not been told,

00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:06,600
get registered today for this free event,

00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:09,600
the best of the chronic Lyme disease summit,

00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:11,000
and I'll see you inside.

